msgctxt "Addon Summary"
msgid "SSH File Transfer Protocol support"
msgstr "Tacaíocht do Phrótacal Aistrithe Comhad SSH"

msgctxt "Addon Description"
msgid "The SSH File Transfer Protocol (also Secure File Transfer Protocol, or SFTP) is a network protocol that provides file access, file transfer, and file management over any reliable data stream.[CR][CR]This addon allows file access to data in it."
msgstr "Is prótacal líonra é an Prótacal Aistrithe Comhad SSH (Prótacal Aistrithe Comhad Slán, nó SFTP freisin) a sholáthraíonn rochtain comhad, aistriú comhad, agus bainistíocht comhad thar aon sruth sonraí iontaofa.[CR][CR]Ceadaíonn an breiseán seo rochtain comhad ar shonraí ann."
